('jukwaa-la-kazi','Jukwaa La Kazi','Talk Shows','MC Jumah','Monday to Friday','9:00 AM - 12:00 PM','Kiswahili','Jobs, hustles and enterprise — practical conversations about work, skills and opportunity in Kajiado.',true),
